        "content": "## Free game alert\nEvery 3 hours: Epic free games + GamerPower giveaways, posts only new ones to Discord.\n\n1. Discord: Server settings > Integrations > Webhooks > New > Copy URL.\n2. Paste it in **Post to Discord** (URL field).\n3. Activate. Note: the first run posts everything currently free.\n\nIsThereAnyDeal wishlist prices: see the Python version.",
